content.push(H2("\"I do not have time for another call.\""));
content.push(ScriptBlock("Get it. The Revenue Leak Audit is 45 minutes, and for $29 you walk away with a real diagnostic of your business plus her KPI Calculator to keep using whether you ever work with her or not.\n\nMost owners tell me the call itself was the most clarity they have had on their own numbers in a year. Worst case, you spend 45 minutes and learn something. Best case, you find the leak that has been costing you all year."));

content.push(H2("\"Send me some info first.\""));
content.push(ScriptBlock("I could, but honestly the website will not tell you what is actually happening inside your specific practice. The whole point of the Revenue Leak Audit is that it is tailored to your numbers and your market, not a generic deck. And the $29 includes the KPI Calculator so you can run your own numbers afterward.\n\nIf you want the short version, the site is theluxoracollective.co. But the call is where you actually find out if it is a fit."));

content.push(H2("\"We are slammed right now, can you reach out in a few months?\""));
content.push(ScriptBlock("Hear you. Quick question though, are you slammed because you are booked solid, or slammed because the systems are not running without you?\n\nIf it is the second one, that is literally what Luxora fixes. Waiting three months usually just means three more months of the same problem. The audit does not take any of your time, Bethany Anne does the work and walks you through it. Worth 45 minutes to find out."));

content.push(H2("\"I have tried consultants before, did not work.\""));
content.push(ScriptBlock("Yeah, that is a common one, and most of the time it is because the consultant gave a 60-page strategy doc and disappeared. Luxora is built the opposite way.\n\nIt is done-with-you. They install the systems alongside your team, train your staff, and stay in the business for at least a year. The goal is for you to own the playbook at the end, not to keep paying them forever.\n\nBethany Anne has actually run med spas herself, so she is not theorizing. The Revenue Leak Audit will show you immediately whether her approach is different from what you have seen before."));

content.push(H2("\"Is this just for big practices?\""));
content.push(ScriptBlock("Actually the opposite. Luxora is specifically built for independent practices in the $500K to $2M range. Bigger groups have in-house teams. Solo injectors are not ready yet. The owners she works best with are the ones who have built something real but feel like the business depends on them being in every consult, every decision, every fire."));

content.push(H2("\"Why should I trust her over [other coach or guru in the space]?\""));
